      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "……ああ、ひらめいたぜ。\r\nこの橋が、オレの元いた世界につながる方法をな。",
        "official_en": "Indeed I do. I remember the way back to my world is through this bridge!",
        "real_en": "...Yeah, I've got an idea. I think I know how this bridge can connect to my old world."
      },
