      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "おおっ……似ているぞ……なつかしいあの橋に……。\r\nそうか……そういうことか！",
        "official_en": "Ah! It’s...it’s the spitting image of... A-HA!",
        "real_en": "Oh... It looks like that bridge I remember so fondly...! I see... Now I get it!"
      },
