      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だが、それにはお前たちの「力」がいる。\r\n魂をかけた本気の力で……決着をつけるんだ。",
        "official_en": "However, I will need your might. What say you to an all-out decisive battle that will put our very lives on the line?",
        "real_en": "But I'll need your strength for that. We have to settle this in a fight with everything we've got."
      },
